ови (быстрее при низком уровне здоровья). При максимальной жажде Сильвер автоматически применяет «Ликантропию».<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Активное:</span> Сильвер мгновенно трансформируется, что даёт ей бонусы к <panel class=\"InlineAttributeIcon MaxHealth\" replacechar=\"_\"><span class=\"InlineAttributeName MaxHealth\">макс. здоровью</span>, а также накапливаемое повышение <panel class=\"InlineAttributeIcon FireRate\" replacechar=\"_\"><span class=\"InlineAttributeName FireRate\">скорострельности</span> против вражеских героев. <span class=\"highlight\">Умения и оружие героини</span> заменяются свирепыми версиями.","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_ability_sprint","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2207638101","name":"Dash","nameRu":"Рывок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_dash","description":"","abilityType":"